abstract: >-
  A public reference notebook and supporting resources for converting source
  text into typed, evidence-linked knowledge graphs for policy and conflict
  analysis, with model-assisted extraction, validation, entity resolution,
  graph construction, and inspectable post-extraction analysis.
keywords:
  - policy analysis
  - conflict analysis
  - knowledge graphs
  - evidence grounding
  - provenance
  - Jupyter
